    <div class="section-title">Summary & Legal Determination</div>
    <div class="notes-box">
        <strong>Statutory Assessment:</strong> Inspection findings require manual review and verification by the authorized Legal Metrology officer before any statutory determination.
        
            <br><span style="font-size: 8pt; color: #424655; font-style: italic;">Officer Remarks: Statutory inspection completed.</span>
        
    </div>

